r del País Basc. Pendent de sègles, lo gascon i foguèt la lenga de la carrièra e dels actes ; lo basc i èra tanben parlat. Ara, lo basc se i transmet subretot per l'escòla. En 2018, l'aglomeracion del País Basc a reconegut lo gascon, al costat del basc.","fr":"Bayonne, Anglet, Biarritz et Le Boucau : des villes de tradition gasconne au cœur du Pays basque. Pendant des siècles, le gascon y a été la langue de la rue et des actes ; le basque y était aussi parlé. Aujourd'hui, le basque s'y transmet surtout par l'école. En 2018, l'agglomération Pays basque a reconnu officiellement le gascon, à côté du basque."},"eti":[-1.474,43.484]},"geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-1.53558,43.46092],[-1.54005,43.45409],[-1.53996,43.44764],[-1.55184,43.44741],[-1.56225,43.45101],[-1.56788,43.45955],[-1.57706,43.46271],[-1.56678,43.47788],[-1.5664,43.48037],[-1.56944,43.48184],[-1.56774,43.48272],[-1.57095,43.48435],[-1.56122,43.48359],[-1.55283,43.49091],[-1.55531,43.49424],[-1.54869,43.49284],[-1.5467,43.49441],[-1.54246,43.50352],[-1.54027,43.50339],[-1.52656,43.52212],[-1.52607,43.52451],[-1.52934,43.52568],[-1.52548,43.52462],[-1.52412,43.52743],[-1.52641,43.52804],[-1.52445,43.52899],[-1.50176,43.52712],[-1.50084,43.52909],[-1.49405,43.52849],[-1.49038,43.53352],[-1.47697,43.5395],[-1.47174,43.53384],[-1.46097,43.53313],[-1.46578,43.51632],[-1.45929,43.51887],[-1.45429,43.51605],[-1.44676,43.51581],[-1.43996,43.51317],[-1.43116,43.5145],[-1.42357,43.50442],[-1.41838,43.50234],[-1.41777,43.49701],[-1.42686,43.49508],[-1.4343,43.48994],[-1.44513,43.48624],[-1.4452,43.4788],[-1.45016,43.47552],[-1.45395,43.47478],[-1.45993,43.48038],[-1.46783,43.47623],[-1.46619,43.47504],[-1.46686,43.47165],[-1.4698,43.47092],[-1.46892,43.46677],[-1.48037,43.46584],[-1.48108,43.4607],[-1.48598,43.45785],[-1.48476,43.45516],[-1.49037,43.45461],[-1.49354,43.44987],[-1.50466,43.45144],[-1.51326,43.45037],[-1.52053,43.45738],[-1.53558,43.46092]]],[[[-1.55724,43.48962],[-1.55712,43.4892